    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1">

                <pb facs="0075" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg1"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/272</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-25T16:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 25, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 26, 12.15
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1056. Duma meeting February 27 anticipated with great uneasiness. Concerted
                    action effort to produce strike and lawless demonstrations. Petrograd governor
                    posted proclamations condemning strike and stating city under military law which
                    [will] be enforced. Have requested guard for Austrian Embassy. Street-car gossip
                    threatening toward our successors [secretaries] who charged being German
                    sympathizers. Populace ignorant that we still represent Austria.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
